<td id="S3.T1.3.1.8.8" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center">state-of-the-art open-source model</td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T1.3.1.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T1.3.1.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">BL</td>
<td id="S3.T1.3.1.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">MARS2</td>
