<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S3.T1.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 1</span>: </span><span id="S3.T1.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Final leaderboard of MARS2 2025. Only the Top5 teams of each track evaluated by the MARS2 committee are listed. See our website for full ranking lists. “BL”: baseline methods implemented by the MARS2 committee. “Generalist”: generalist model. “Verified”: the method has been verified by the committee. <span id="S3.T1.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Lens</span> and <span id="S3.T1.9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">AdsQA</span> can be downloaded from our GitHub organization page <a href="https://github.com/mars2workshop" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://github.com/mars2workshop</a>.</span></figcaption>
